    "body": "## Summary\n- When `gkd_logits_topk` is unset, defer local teacher full-vocabulary logits to `forward_step` so only one `[S, V]` tensor is alive per micro-batch instead of one per rollout batch during preparation.\n- Extract `_compute_teacher_output_local` for single-micro-batch teacher forwards; keep top-k teacher outputs eager at batch prep (small tensors).\n- Add regression tests for defer vs eager paths and JIT computation in `forward_step`.\n\nFixes #10097\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] `python -m pytest tests/megatron/test_gkd_teacher_logits_defer.py -q` (3 passed locally; skips when megatron-core/transformers are unavailable)\n- [ ] Megatron GKD full-vocab training smoke on GPU (maintainer/CI)\n\nMade with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)",
